# Build output. Listed per-path rather than as a bare `dist/` on purpose: git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so a blanket
# `dist/` would take packages/tokens/dist with it and no `!` rule could rescue it.
apps/docs/dist/

# packages/tokens/dist IS committed, deliberately. Consumers resolve the package
# through the workspace with no publish step, so dist must be present — and a diff
# on report.json is how a brand or contrast regression becomes visible in review
# rather than at runtime.
